                <p>See footnote 9, <ref target="#pg395">p. 395</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d315-f2" n="18" xml:id="d315-f2-content">
                <p>Clement R. Attlee, British Prime Minister.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
